Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、参与软/硬件产品的需求分析与设计工作，识别可测试性需求，参与产品需求分析;\n2、设计和执行详尽的测试计划，以确保产品功能、性\n岗位职责能、可靠性和安全性符合预期标准;\n3、进行系统测试、集成测试、负载测试和UT测试，包括自\n动化测试脚本的编写和执行;\n4、协助制定公司测试标准，不断更新和制定测试规范及各指导手册，完善测试规范体系。\n岗位要求：","Require":"1、3年以上测试经验，其中至少2年整机测试经验，计算机科学或自动化相关专业;\n2、精通测试方法论，具备制定和实施高效测试策略的能力，有机器人产品测试经验者优先;\n岗位任职要求\n3、具备 软硬件调试能力;\n4、熟悉自动化测试工具和框架，能够独立搭建测试环境;\n5、具备优秀的问题分析和解决能力，以及在压力下保持高效率工作的能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-09-11T17:38:20","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"9816804c-ee53-4338-821e-b42a8177a80d","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511066603,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级C++开发工程师","OrgId":2149295,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 负责公司软件架构的升级，优化；\n2. 负责公司API的集成．测试，并持续优化；\n3. 负责产品软件的升级．降级．系统修复；\n4. 与产品团队配合，完成B端大客户的定制化需求。","Require":"1. 2-5年C++开发经验，精通C++11/14/17标准及STL，具备良好的编码风格和设计模式素养；熟悉Linux环境开发调试，掌握网络编程、多线程编程及性能优化技术。\n2. 具备ROS2、DDS、gRPC、ZMQ等通信中间件的实际项目经验，深入理解其核心通信机制与应用场景。\n3. 加分项包含但不限于如下部分：具有智能驾驶、机器人、智能硬件或物联网行业背景；熟练使用Docker进行环境封装与部署；掌握Python/Go等辅助开发语言；有开源贡献或高质量GitHub项目；对ROS2、DDS等开源通信中间件有源码级分析或优化经验。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-09-11T17:36:21","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"09a7af9a-cf8f-429a-a5fd-4109d2cc0951","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511066594,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"海外技术支持工程师","OrgId":2149294,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 以公司产品（四足机器人、六轴协作机械臂等）为核心，协助销售部门进行售前售中售后技术支持；\n2. 负责对客户进行产品软硬件培训（硬件操作、软件使用以及二次开发等），完成设备交付；\n3. 负责设备交付后的技术答疑、故障诊断处理、安排售后维修等工作；\n4. 基于日常培训内容、整理已知问题解决办法，总结形成文档、视频，形成、完善产品知识库；\n5. 整理产品问题、客户需求，形成合理的研发需求反馈给研发/产品经理，促进产品完善、升级；\n6. 负责样机及售后备用机仓库管理，建立售后机器管理流程。负责制定售后标准化服务流程，并完成过程管控；\n7. 售前技术部分工作内容：负责机器人巡检、监控集成项目需求调研，充分与销售人员、客户沟通交流，对需求进行挖掘和引导，输出解决方案，进行客户现场踏勘、需求分析、技术方案编制；负责与客户进行技术交流，技术方案讲解，机器人演示等工作。","Req